###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020217> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> ;
                                      rdfs:label "DEPRECATED short range order"@en ;
                                      skos:definition "DEPRECATED periodic arrangement of structural features up to a few entities"@en ,
                                                      "DEPRECATED periodische Anordnung von Strukturmerkmalen bis hin zu wenigen Einheiten"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020218
<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020218> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020216> ;
                                      rdfs:label "DEPRECATED medium range order"@en ;
                                      skos:definition "DEPRECATED periodic arrangement of structural features of many entities"@en ,
                                                      "DEPRECATED periodische Anordnung struktureller Merkmale vieler Entitäten"@de .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020219
